WEBVTT

00:00:08.919 --> 00:00:10.553
Oh, Roy!

00:00:10.553 --> 00:00:12.088
Where've you been?

00:00:12.088 --> 00:00:14.022
Solty's already...

00:00:22.799 --> 00:00:26.792
Oh, welcome home, Mr. Roy.

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:32.571
I am sorry.

00:00:34.678 --> 00:00:38.882
Um, I was... that is...

00:00:38.882 --> 00:00:43.546
Oh, no, I should be
the one to be... that is...

00:00:46.523 --> 00:00:49.492
Oh, um...

00:00:49.492 --> 00:00:53.029
I have been cooking, you know.

00:00:53.029 --> 00:00:54.963
Please try my cooking.

00:00:57.267 --> 00:00:58.564
Sure.

00:01:03.573 --> 00:01:05.375
Help yourself.

00:01:05.375 --> 00:01:06.865
Okay.

00:01:11.815 --> 00:01:13.339
How is it?

00:01:18.888 --> 00:01:20.947
It's not bad.

00:01:29.399 --> 00:01:37.140
Nee ima made shiritakatta
otogi-banashi no tsuzuki

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:43.568
Eien ni owaranai
shiawase nara kono te de

00:01:45.315 --> 00:01:55.291
Bokura wa marude
ichimai-chigai no guuzen o sagashiatte

00:01:55.291 --> 00:01:57.460
Meguriatta

00:01:57.460 --> 00:02:05.568
Kimi ga itsuka nomikonda sono kotoba yori

00:02:05.568 --> 00:02:14.477
Zutto iezu ni itekureteta yasashisa o

00:02:14.477 --> 00:02:21.451
Shinjitai to ima omounda

00:02:21.451 --> 00:02:29.192
Nee kono saki wa doko made
mo fuan to tonari-awase

00:02:29.192 --> 00:02:35.598
Nakusu mono ga nakatta
bokutachi wa mou inai

00:02:35.598 --> 00:02:43.306
Nee ima made shiranakatta
otogi-banashi no tsuzuki

00:02:43.306 --> 00:02:49.612
Eien ni owaranai
shiawase nara kono te de

00:02:49.612 --> 00:02:53.514
Tsumikasanete yuku mono

00:03:01.357 --> 00:03:05.953
"Welcome Home"

00:03:15.836 --> 00:03:18.338
The infants found by the authorities

00:03:18.338 --> 00:03:20.874
- appear to be doing fine.
- Okay, all done.

00:03:20.874 --> 00:03:22.910
- Moving on to the next news item.
- Thank you very much.

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:24.611
We have an update on the murder

00:03:24.611 --> 00:03:28.248
that took place yesterday
within the RUC's Security Department.

00:03:28.248 --> 00:03:30.284
This afternoon, investigation headquarters

00:03:30.284 --> 00:03:33.020
issued arrest warrants for the
co-workers of the victim, Silvia Ban.

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:37.491
The warrants are for Integra Martel,
Celica Yayoi, and Accela Warrick

00:03:37.491 --> 00:03:40.360
on suspicion of murder.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:44.631
Investigation HQ believes some kind
of trouble within the company...

00:03:44.631 --> 00:03:46.189
We've been outmaneuvered.

00:03:48.168 --> 00:03:49.328
Tell me about it.

00:03:55.709 --> 00:03:57.370
Stop it, Celica!

00:04:17.664 --> 00:04:19.967
Such a nuisance.

00:04:19.967 --> 00:04:24.071
Division Chief, I am placing you
under arrest for murder.

00:04:24.071 --> 00:04:28.342
Please put both hands on your head
and get down on your knees.

00:04:28.342 --> 00:04:32.039
All I did was eliminate
a useless subordinate.

00:04:38.085 --> 00:04:38.986
They're getting away!

00:04:38.986 --> 00:04:40.783
Shut the gate immediately!

00:04:42.222 --> 00:04:45.726
So, what do we do now?

00:04:45.726 --> 00:04:48.395
We prove our innocence.

00:04:48.395 --> 00:04:50.097
How do we do that?

00:04:50.097 --> 00:04:55.302
First, we hack into the RUC's computers
and gather information.

00:04:55.302 --> 00:04:57.037
Security camera images,

00:04:57.037 --> 00:04:59.806
communications logs,
records of ingress and egress.

00:04:59.806 --> 00:05:01.541
Anything we can get.

00:05:01.541 --> 00:05:06.346
We just gather whatever information
we can to substantiate our alibi.

00:05:06.346 --> 00:05:10.550
If things go well, we'll also be able
to prove that the division chief did it.

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:12.619
Can I count on you for that, Accela?

00:05:12.619 --> 00:05:13.854
Yes.

00:05:13.854 --> 00:05:16.757
Then it looks like
there's nothing for me to do.

00:05:16.757 --> 00:05:18.625
C-Celica?

00:05:18.625 --> 00:05:20.183
Bye-bye.

00:05:38.078 --> 00:05:40.647
Hey! Stop!

00:05:40.647 --> 00:05:42.581
As if I'd stop.

00:05:48.822 --> 00:05:50.557
That hurt...

00:05:50.557 --> 00:05:53.025
Hey, watch where you're...

00:05:54.928 --> 00:05:56.963
Rose!

00:05:56.963 --> 00:05:58.799
Just the person I need!

00:05:58.799 --> 00:06:00.400
What's with that getup?

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:02.569
Never mind. I'm being chased.

00:06:02.569 --> 00:06:06.673
Help me like you always do. Okay?

00:06:06.673 --> 00:06:08.308
Wha?!

00:06:08.308 --> 00:06:09.276
Rose!

00:06:09.276 --> 00:06:11.176
What's the big idea?

00:06:15.082 --> 00:06:17.117
There you are!

00:06:17.117 --> 00:06:18.819
Caught you!

00:06:18.819 --> 00:06:20.420
Steal from me, will you?!

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:21.855
You're an unbelievable brat!

00:06:21.855 --> 00:06:24.257
What's it to you?! It was only a little!

00:06:24.257 --> 00:06:25.592
You're a registered resident anyway!

00:06:25.592 --> 00:06:28.362
So you're unregistered...

00:06:28.362 --> 00:06:29.629
What's the matter?

00:06:29.629 --> 00:06:31.231
What's this commotion?

00:06:31.231 --> 00:06:32.566
Take her away.

00:06:32.566 --> 00:06:34.234
She was caught stealing.

00:06:34.234 --> 00:06:35.369
Huh?

00:06:35.369 --> 00:06:38.071
- Make it quick!
- R-Right.

00:06:38.071 --> 00:06:39.873
Come along. This way!

00:06:39.873 --> 00:06:41.108
Ow!

00:06:41.108 --> 00:06:42.943
What's with you, Rose?!

00:06:42.943 --> 00:06:44.706
You traitor!

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:49.649
There was no need to
take it that far, was there?

00:06:49.649 --> 00:06:52.986
I'd have been happy as long as
I got my goods back.

00:06:52.986 --> 00:06:55.622
- She's still a child.
- So what?

00:06:55.622 --> 00:06:59.626
Even children should be punished
if they commit a crime!

00:06:59.626 --> 00:07:03.995
If she doesn't know right from wrong,
this is the perfect chance to teach her!

00:07:10.203 --> 00:07:15.072
This is why unregistered residents
can never improve their station in life.

00:07:26.119 --> 00:07:29.350
This is everything you asked for.

00:07:33.293 --> 00:07:36.496
Hey, cut that out.

00:07:36.496 --> 00:07:38.064
But what's going on?

00:07:38.064 --> 00:07:42.769
What do you intend to do with all these?

00:07:42.769 --> 00:07:46.306
You planning to start a war or something?

00:07:46.306 --> 00:07:49.109
A war, huh?

00:07:49.109 --> 00:07:50.303
That's not a bad idea.

00:07:52.579 --> 00:07:54.648
Y-You know, I'm having second thoughts...

00:07:54.648 --> 00:07:56.716
Hey, stop moving.

00:07:56.716 --> 00:07:58.051
Isn't that a bit too much?

00:07:58.051 --> 00:07:59.619
That's why it works!

00:07:59.619 --> 00:08:01.455
When he sees the new Silvia,

00:08:01.455 --> 00:08:05.559
your dreamboat Division Chief
might just fall for you!

00:08:05.559 --> 00:08:07.925
Silly! That's not why I...

00:08:09.896 --> 00:08:13.233
What?! Stop laughing!

00:08:13.233 --> 00:08:14.723
Celica!

00:08:18.638 --> 00:08:20.073
Look, Celica...

00:08:20.073 --> 00:08:21.563
Don't say it.

00:08:26.446 --> 00:08:27.913
Don't get yourself killed.

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:31.879
I won't.

00:08:39.359 --> 00:08:41.828
I guess it's back to work, Roy?

00:08:41.828 --> 00:08:44.194
Yeah, I suppose so.

00:08:45.065 --> 00:08:47.067
We're counting on you, cash cow.

00:08:47.067 --> 00:08:49.469
Work hard.

00:08:49.469 --> 00:08:52.072
I'm so sorry, Roy.

00:08:52.072 --> 00:08:54.474
Nah, it's okay.

00:08:54.474 --> 00:08:56.142
S-S-S-S-Solty?!

00:08:56.142 --> 00:08:59.279
I-lf you were "half kidding",
does that mean you were half serious?

00:08:59.279 --> 00:09:01.715
J-Just what d-d-d-d-d-did
you mean by that?

00:09:01.715 --> 00:09:02.909
Pardon?

00:09:06.553 --> 00:09:08.822
Any good jobs for me?

00:09:08.822 --> 00:09:11.024
Hold on a minute.

00:09:11.024 --> 00:09:12.685
How about this one?

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:16.429
A former bank employee
who embezzled money.

00:09:16.429 --> 00:09:18.465
He's currently on the run.

00:09:18.465 --> 00:09:21.268
No hunters office has taken the job yet,

00:09:21.268 --> 00:09:23.303
so now might be your chance.

00:09:23.303 --> 00:09:26.940
He's a bit small-time for me, but why not?

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:28.909
S-So, being h-half...

00:09:28.909 --> 00:09:30.644
- Solty.
- Yes?

00:09:30.644 --> 00:09:33.013
We have a job. Let's go.

00:09:33.013 --> 00:09:34.446
Oh, coming!

00:09:36.983 --> 00:09:39.110
Wait, S-Solty!

00:09:41.121 --> 00:09:42.884
Look, you...

00:09:48.061 --> 00:09:50.030
What?!

00:09:50.030 --> 00:09:51.631
I dare you to say that again!

00:09:51.631 --> 00:09:55.268
C-Calm down, Andy.

00:09:55.268 --> 00:09:57.070
This had better not be some kind of BS.

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:58.638
It's no lie.

00:09:58.638 --> 00:10:01.937
It's a widespread rumor among
the people who've been up there.

00:10:20.093 --> 00:10:23.763
Hey, you know about
that murder at the RUC?

00:10:23.763 --> 00:10:26.499
I heard they still
haven't caught the killers.

00:10:26.499 --> 00:10:27.968
It's scary.

00:10:27.968 --> 00:10:31.204
They're supposed to be
armed and on the run, right?

00:10:31.204 --> 00:10:33.173
And they're so young, too.

00:10:33.173 --> 00:10:36.142
I guess looks can be deceiving.

00:10:36.142 --> 00:10:39.168
I hope they get caught soon.

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:06.206
I'm back.

00:11:06.206 --> 00:11:08.742
Integra...

00:11:08.742 --> 00:11:10.176
Welcome back.

00:11:10.176 --> 00:11:15.015
Sorry, I couldn't find
the bay laurel leaves.

00:11:15.015 --> 00:11:17.381
Oh, that's all right. I'll manage.

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:25.258
The RUC had already
seized our apartments.

00:11:25.258 --> 00:11:29.062
And they'd hauled away
everything we had in our rooms.

00:11:29.062 --> 00:11:30.163
I see.

00:11:30.163 --> 00:11:31.798
Anything on your end?

00:11:31.798 --> 00:11:37.704
Practically all the data related
to the incident has been erased, but...

00:11:37.704 --> 00:11:38.938
What is it?

00:11:38.938 --> 00:11:40.405
Please look at this.

00:11:45.679 --> 00:11:50.776
Investigation headquarters is already
looking at this data as evidence.

00:11:52.485 --> 00:11:53.920
I see.

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:57.791
It hasn't even been two days
since then, but already...

00:11:57.791 --> 00:12:01.194
In this short time,
he prepared all this fake data

00:12:01.194 --> 00:12:04.130
and managed to erase
the evidential information.

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:06.566
His handling of this is just too neat.

00:12:06.566 --> 00:12:10.904
It's as if he had made preparations
in advance for just such an incident.

00:12:10.904 --> 00:12:11.838
What?

00:12:11.838 --> 00:12:14.374
I had a vague suspicion
that something was amiss.

00:12:14.374 --> 00:12:16.209
If I had only realized it sooner,

00:12:16.209 --> 00:12:17.677
I could've done something at that time...

00:12:17.677 --> 00:12:18.837
At that time?

00:12:34.461 --> 00:12:38.565
Accela, if you know anything
at all, tell me about it!

00:12:38.565 --> 00:12:39.466
For example,

00:12:39.466 --> 00:12:42.731
what was the program you and
the division chief were working on?

00:12:49.242 --> 00:12:50.577
Please tell me.

00:12:50.577 --> 00:12:55.139
It might lead to a breakthrough
in our situation!

00:12:56.316 --> 00:12:57.840
Accela!

00:13:00.754 --> 00:13:02.255
You're right.

00:13:02.255 --> 00:13:03.923
I'm no longer an employee,

00:13:03.923 --> 00:13:05.891
so I have no obligation
to maintain confidentiality.

00:13:07.026 --> 00:13:08.595
I will tell you.

00:13:08.595 --> 00:13:12.554
The program that I was working on
with the division chief was...

00:13:35.889 --> 00:13:36.656
She's on the run!

00:13:36.656 --> 00:13:38.214
Down! After her!

00:13:46.132 --> 00:13:49.469
I'll be the decoy, so you get away.

00:13:49.469 --> 00:13:52.199
We'll meet up later. All right?

00:13:55.141 --> 00:13:58.178
The RUC's just as incompetent as ever.

00:13:58.178 --> 00:14:02.382
To think they still haven't
found something this big.

00:14:02.382 --> 00:14:05.112
Well, it's a big help to me, though.

00:14:07.353 --> 00:14:10.151
Should I begin it? The war...

00:14:16.963 --> 00:14:20.266
This body's going to autopsy. Section 5.

00:14:20.266 --> 00:14:21.460
Yes, sir.

00:14:22.969 --> 00:14:26.370
What's with you, Rose?! You traitor!

00:14:28.274 --> 00:14:30.743
Even before this...

00:14:30.743 --> 00:14:32.011
Even before this,

00:14:32.011 --> 00:14:35.448
numerous unregistered residents
have fallen victim.

00:14:35.448 --> 00:14:39.219
Irene... and everyone else...

00:14:39.219 --> 00:14:41.020
I've made up my mind.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.822
So don't waver! Don't waver!

00:14:42.822 --> 00:14:44.057
Don't waver!

00:14:44.057 --> 00:14:45.820
I've made up my mind!

00:14:49.062 --> 00:14:50.830
Take call.

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:52.432
It's me.

00:14:52.432 --> 00:14:54.567
We've tracked them down.

00:14:54.567 --> 00:14:58.004
I want you to head immediately
to their location as well.

00:14:58.004 --> 00:14:59.539
Understood.

00:14:59.539 --> 00:15:00.506
I'm counting on you.

00:15:06.379 --> 00:15:10.577
With money, even I can
arm myself like this!

00:15:17.857 --> 00:15:19.125
Good grief.

00:15:19.125 --> 00:15:22.686
For a petty embezzler,
he's sure making things difficult.

00:15:26.065 --> 00:15:27.734
Damn.

00:15:27.734 --> 00:15:29.964
The guy's got fast feet.

00:15:30.937 --> 00:15:33.838
Catch me if you can!

00:15:35.441 --> 00:15:37.777
Oh, um...

00:15:37.777 --> 00:15:39.608
Are you all right?

00:15:42.849 --> 00:15:45.151
Good job, Solty.

00:15:45.151 --> 00:15:48.416
He ran into me on his own.

00:15:49.989 --> 00:15:51.057
Let's go.

00:15:51.057 --> 00:15:53.893
We'll turn him over to the police,
then have dinner.

00:15:53.893 --> 00:15:54.791
Right.

00:16:02.802 --> 00:16:04.437
Accela Warrick...

00:16:04.437 --> 00:16:07.173
We have orders to shoot to kill you.

00:16:07.173 --> 00:16:11.411
But before we do,
let's have some fun while we can.

00:16:11.411 --> 00:16:13.446
Don't make a fuss, now.

00:16:13.446 --> 00:16:14.647
This is too much trouble.

00:16:14.647 --> 00:16:17.517
Put one through her legs
so she can't make a run for it.

00:16:17.517 --> 00:16:19.348
Oh, good thinking.

00:16:30.129 --> 00:16:31.926
Damn good-for-nothings!

00:16:36.402 --> 00:16:37.960
Celica!

00:16:39.172 --> 00:16:42.475
What're you doing in a place like this?

00:16:42.475 --> 00:16:44.377
Where's Integra?

00:16:44.377 --> 00:16:48.748
Oh, um... They stormed the room
and we got separated.

00:16:48.748 --> 00:16:50.950
Celica, that suit...

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:52.679
Oh, this?

00:16:59.125 --> 00:17:02.424
Oh, dear, here they all come.

00:17:04.530 --> 00:17:05.465
Hurry up and run!

00:17:05.465 --> 00:17:06.666
Or you'll get caught in the crossfire.

00:17:06.666 --> 00:17:08.101
C-Celica...

00:17:08.101 --> 00:17:08.901
Get going.

00:17:08.901 --> 00:17:10.737
- But...
- You're in the way!

00:17:10.737 --> 00:17:12.102
Get going already!

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:16.476
Don't make it harder for me...

00:17:16.476 --> 00:17:20.173
Go on ahead and have dinner ready for us.

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:23.241
I'll be sure to join you.

00:17:29.722 --> 00:17:31.986
Okay, you're on!

00:17:35.962 --> 00:17:36.863
Oh...

00:17:36.863 --> 00:17:38.564
Huh? What's the matter?

00:17:38.564 --> 00:17:39.758
Gunshots...

00:17:42.035 --> 00:17:44.237
- Oh...
- Ouch!

00:17:44.237 --> 00:17:45.704
You are...

00:17:48.541 --> 00:17:50.008
You?

00:17:54.614 --> 00:17:55.882
Let's go.

00:17:55.882 --> 00:17:58.214
Oh... Okay.

00:17:59.519 --> 00:18:00.653
Hurry up.

00:18:00.653 --> 00:18:01.587
Right!

00:18:01.587 --> 00:18:02.955
Not good enough!

00:18:02.955 --> 00:18:07.483
Take better aim or this little girl
is going to wipe out all of you!

00:18:08.327 --> 00:18:10.761
C'mon! C'mon! C'mon! C'mon!

00:18:16.269 --> 00:18:17.429
Uh-oh!

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:24.901
Go on ahead and have dinner ready for us.

00:18:32.752 --> 00:18:34.821
Oh, welcome.

00:18:34.821 --> 00:18:37.156
To what do we owe this surprise?

00:18:37.156 --> 00:18:39.092
Where's the old man?

00:18:39.092 --> 00:18:40.159
Roy?

00:18:40.159 --> 00:18:41.928
He's out on a job.

00:18:41.928 --> 00:18:42.962
When is he coming back?

00:18:42.962 --> 00:18:43.996
When?

00:18:43.996 --> 00:18:45.865
Call him back here. Right now!

00:18:45.865 --> 00:18:48.367
Calm down, Andy!

00:18:48.367 --> 00:18:49.766
What's the matter?

00:18:52.472 --> 00:18:55.808
No sense taking chances back there.

00:18:55.808 --> 00:18:57.673
My objective is...

00:19:04.484 --> 00:19:06.418
She shows up at last.

00:19:08.554 --> 00:19:10.423
Is it true?

00:19:10.423 --> 00:19:14.189
That Rose is alive
and working for the RUC?!

00:19:16.462 --> 00:19:19.499
Here I was, thinking we could get along...

00:19:19.499 --> 00:19:21.200
Listen to me, Celica.

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:22.668
Murderer!

00:19:22.668 --> 00:19:23.436
Celica!

00:19:23.436 --> 00:19:26.439
You're in cahoots with that
masked bastard, aren't you?!

00:19:26.439 --> 00:19:27.599
Hear me out!

00:19:29.308 --> 00:19:30.643
What is it?

00:19:30.643 --> 00:19:33.737
Just now... I heard Miss Rose's voice...

00:19:36.182 --> 00:19:38.275
Wait, Solty!

00:19:39.485 --> 00:19:43.256
Because you showed up,
everything's a mess!

00:19:43.256 --> 00:19:45.324
Give yourself up, Celica.

00:19:45.324 --> 00:19:47.260
You can't keep running forever.

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:50.096
I don't plan on running forever.

00:19:50.096 --> 00:19:51.564
Are you out for revenge?

00:19:51.564 --> 00:19:54.226
Silvia is dead!

00:19:57.203 --> 00:19:58.371
Hey...

00:19:58.371 --> 00:19:59.672
You heard Rose's voice?

00:19:59.672 --> 00:20:00.764
Up there.

00:20:07.013 --> 00:20:08.114
It's useless.

00:20:08.114 --> 00:20:11.484
That gun can't penetrate this suit.

00:20:11.484 --> 00:20:13.920
There's still time. Give yourself up.

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:15.555
It's too late!

00:20:15.555 --> 00:20:20.293
Why were we set up
as Silvia's killers anyway?!

00:20:20.293 --> 00:20:21.783
It's not too late!

00:20:24.163 --> 00:20:27.700
If you didn't do it,
then you just have to prove it!

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:29.402
The right way, in a court of law!

00:20:29.402 --> 00:20:31.529
I don't trust you!

00:20:32.805 --> 00:20:35.137
All right, then how about now?

00:20:40.713 --> 00:20:42.681
Still don't trust me?

00:20:45.117 --> 00:20:47.220
Rose...

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:48.448
What?

00:20:49.956 --> 00:20:52.686
I'll send the masked bastard
right after you!

00:21:21.087 --> 00:21:22.655
Rose?

00:21:22.655 --> 00:21:24.213
Miss Rose...

00:21:52.583 --> 00:21:57.354
Hareta hi no kouen

00:21:57.354 --> 00:22:00.290
Miageta sora ni

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:09.062
Kiesou ni natta chiisana Little Cloud

00:22:11.568 --> 00:22:16.340
Kaze ni mi o makasete

00:22:16.340 --> 00:22:19.276
Jiyuu ni ikiru

00:22:19.276 --> 00:22:25.681
Sukoshi-zutsu aruku watashi-tachi

00:22:27.317 --> 00:22:30.343
Onnaji dane

00:22:32.089 --> 00:22:36.827
Taisetsu na jikan

00:22:36.827 --> 00:22:40.664
Deau tabi ni

00:22:40.664 --> 00:22:50.207
Hitori ja nai kono kimochi
yasashisa ni naru

00:22:50.207 --> 00:22:56.813
Dareka o shinjiru yuuki ni kaete

00:22:56.813 --> 00:23:08.589
Kitto kono mama
ano sora no hate ni kieru mae ni

00:23:15.565 --> 00:23:18.268
You will catch a cold.

00:23:18.268 --> 00:23:20.404
Um, I...

00:23:20.404 --> 00:23:23.373
Next time, "Everyone, Rally Together!"

00:23:23.373 --> 00:23:25.542
Welcome, everybody!
